WEBVTT

00:00:00.587 --> 00:00:01.231
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.094 --> 00:00:06.987
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Open your books, please. Go to page 7.

00:00:08.261 --> 00:00:10.914
<v><b>Student:</b></v> Sorry, can you repeat that, please?

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.582
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Go to page 7.

00:00:16.385 --> 00:00:16.923
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:18.288 --> 00:00:22.203
<v><b>Student:</b></v> Excuse me. How do you spell ‘birthday’?

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:30.852
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> B-I-R-T-H-D-A-Y.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:34.594
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:37.556 --> 00:00:38.889
<v><b>Student:</b></v> Sorry I’m late.

00:00:40.137 --> 00:00:43.224
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> That’s OK. Sit down, please.